# An update waiting while the sidebar is hidden is said in Cra's toast (X DM 8 Nov 2026: "if I'm
# using the sidebar in the hidden, I may not even notice it"). With the sidebar out the banner says
# it and no toast shows; hiding the sidebar toasts it once, and showing and hiding it again doesn't
# repeat it. A newer update is news again, at once while the sidebar is hidden.
from://open?url=${PAGE}
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
from://debug?bannerReady=0.1.98
wait 1
reject-log update toast
from://action/toggleSidebar
wait 1
expect-log update toast 1: An update is ready! \[Restart\] 0\.1\.98
from://action/toggleSidebar
wait 1
from://action/toggleSidebar
wait 1
reject-log update toast 2
from://debug?bannerReady=0.1.99
wait 1
expect-log update toast 2: An update is ready! \[Restart\] 0\.1\.99
